    {
      "number": 57,
      "category": "",
      "title": "陸績傳",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-057-luji:line039-pei01-02",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "姚信《集》有表称之曰：“臣闻唐、虞之政，举善而教，旌德擢异，三王所先，是以忠臣烈士，显名国朝，淑妇贞女，表迹家闾。盖所以阐崇化业，广殖清风，使苟有令性，幽明俱著，苟怀懿姿，士女同荣。故王蠋建寒松之节而齐王",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-sanguozhi-057-luji:line039-pei01-02"
      ],
      "mention_ids": [
        "c-sanguozhi-057-luji:line039-pei01-02:m0000"
      ],
      "mention_paragraph_ids": {
        "c-sanguozhi-057-luji:line039-pei01-02:m0000": "c-sanguozhi-057-luji:line039-pei01-02"
      },
      "mention_id": "c-sanguozhi-057-luji:line039-pei01-02:m0000",
      "occurrence_groups": [
        {
          "canonical_mention_id": "c-sanguozhi-057-luji:line039-pei01-02:m0000",
          "mention_ids": [
            "c-sanguozhi-057-luji:line039-pei01-02:m0000"
          ],
          "kind": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "work_id": "w-sanguozhi",
      "book_id": "b-sanguozhi-057",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-057-luji",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-057-luji",
      "work_title": "三國志"
    },
    {
      "number": 58,
      "category": "",
      "title": "陸遜傳",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "上，及求詣都，欲口論適庶之分，以匡得失。既不聽許，而遜外生顧譚、顧承、姚信，工以親附太子，枉見流徙。太子太傅吾粲坐數與遜交書，下獄死。權累遣中使責讓遜，遜憤恚致卒，時年六十三。家無餘財。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055"
      ],
      "mention_ids": [
        "c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055:m0231"
      ],
      "mention_paragraph_ids": {
        "c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055:m0231": "c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055"
      },
      "mention_id": "c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line055:m0231",
      "occurrence_groups": [
